  "post_content": "<p>(32 fotos) El Pleno ordinario del Ayuntamiento de Onda aprob&oacute; ayer la constituci&oacute;n de una comisi&oacute;n informativa especial para estudiar y dictaminar la Ordenanza de Transparencia municipal, que actualmente est&aacute; en fase de borrador. En otra sesi&oacute;n plenaria se aprobar&aacute; inicialmente la ordenanza, para someterla a informaci&oacute;n p&uacute;blica y, tras resolver las posibles alegaciones, un nuevo pleno pasar&aacute; a aprobarla definitivamente y entrar&aacute; en vigor.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400093.jpg\" alt=\"p1400093\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400094.jpg\" alt=\"p1400094\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400101.jpg\" alt=\"p1400101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400103.jpg\" alt=\"p1400103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400105.jpg\" alt=\"p1400105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400108.jpg\" alt=\"p1400108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400112.jpg\" alt=\"p1400112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400113.jpg\" alt=\"p1400113\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plegenerajunonda/p1400114.jpg\" alt=\"p1400114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://p